       }
      ],
      "text": "FACT/INFERENCE (S2, S3, S9):"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " parent–child communication; does the child show the parent a book; how the parent sets limits; "
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "eye contact and use of gestures"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " (relevant to autism screening). "
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Autism \"act early\" (S9):"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " this is a designated autism‑screening visit; a child missing milestones or losing skills should be screened and referred. "
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Physical red flags:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " abnormal gait/hand control, poor growth, dental caries, bruising (assess abuse), abdominal mass."
     }
