      "text": "10.3 Developmental milestones at 18 months (CDC 2022) [S3]"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 0,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": 0,
     "spaceBefore": 9,
     "spaceAfter": 9,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": null
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Social/Emotional:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " moves away from you but looks to make sure you are close by; points to show you something interesting; puts hands out for you to wash them; looks at a few pages in a book with you; helps you dress him (pushing arm through a sleeve, lifting a foot). "
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Language/Communication:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " tries to say "
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "three or more words"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " besides \"mama\"/\"dada\"; follows one‑step directions "
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "without any gestures"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " (e.g., \"Give it to me\"). "
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Cognitive:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " copies you doing chores (sweeping); plays with toys in a simple way (pushing a toy car). "
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Movement/Physical:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " walks without holding on; scribbles; drinks from a cup without a lid (may spill); feeds himself with fingers; tries to use a spoon; climbs on and off a couch or chair without help. [S3]"
     }
    ]
   },
