     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Temperament/development/toilet training/behavior/discipline (S2):"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " anticipate "
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "anxiety/clinging in new situations"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "; daily time with the child; plan ahead for difficult situations; consistent discipline/limits; "
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "wait until the child is ready for toilet training"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " (dry ~2 hours, knows wet/dry, can pull pants up/down, can indicate a bowel movement); read potty books, praise attempts; "
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "prepare the toddler for a new sibling"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 36,
     "indRight": 0,
